# Ignore everything by default
*

# Allow the five submission folders and their contents
!01_Dissertation/
!02_Source_Code/
!03_Data/
!04_Images_and_Diagrams/
!05_Presentation/
!01_Dissertation/**
!02_Source_Code/**
!03_Data/**
